{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36646","headline":"故洛阳公镇大梁时隐得游门下今之经历事往人非聊抒所怀以伤以谢 · 罗隐","name":"故洛阳公镇大梁时隐得游门下今之经历事往人非聊抒所怀以伤以谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤舟欲泊思何穷，曾忆西来值雪中。\n珠履少年初满座，白衣游子也从公。\n狂抛赋笔琉璃冷，醉倚歌筵瑇瑁红。\n今日斯文向谁说，泪碑棠树两成空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36646.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36646","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}